@startuml
title Weather Monitoring System - User Authentication and Location Selection

[*] --> LoginOrRegister : [User chooses to log in or register]

state LoginOrRegister
LoginOrRegister --> Register : [New user]
LoginOrRegister --> LogIn : [Registered user]

state Register
Register --> SuccessfulRegistration : [Details are valid]
Register --> InvalidRegistration : [Details are invalid]

state SuccessfulRegistration
SuccessfulRegistration --> Login : [Save user's information and allow login]

state LogIn
LogIn --> SuccessfulLogin : [Username and password match]
LogIn --> IncorrectCredentials : [Username or password is incorrect]

state InvalidRegistration
InvalidRegistration --> RepeatRegistration : [Re-enter details]

state Login
Login --> UserSession : [Allow user to check weather, manage profile, view details, log out]
UserSession --> Logout : [User logs out]

state UserSession
UserSession --> CheckWeather : [Check the weather for current or another location]
UserSession --> InvalidLocation : [New location entered is not valid]
UserSession --> ChooseInfo : [Choose what to check (temperature, humidity, rainfall, pressure, dew point)]
UserSession --> ShowInfo : [Update and show selected weather information]
UserSession --> ViewDetails : [View additional weather details]
@enduml
